# Decision log — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

A dated record of design and data decisions and why they were made, newest first, so people who join later can see how the project got here. Add an entry whenever you make a non-obvious choice: a filtering rule, a definition, a tool, a trade-off. Link the issue or PR where the decision was discussed, because that is usually where it really happened. Tag an entry **Assumed** when it rests on something not yet confirmed, and **Private** when its details must not leave this repository.

## YYYY-MM-DD — <short title of the decision>

- **Context:** what prompted the decision; the constraint or question.
- **Decision:** what was chosen.
- **Why:** the reasoning, alternatives considered, and the trade-off accepted (especially any transparency-versus-privacy trade-off).
- **Consequences:** what this affects downstream; anything to revisit later.
- **Where discussed:** issue or PR link.
